Hi <%= @order.customer_name.to_s.split(" ").first %>,

<% case @order.status %>
<% when "preparing" %>
Good news — Bianna has started preparing your order <%= @order.number %>.
<% when "fulfilled" %>
Your order <%= @order.number %> is complete and on its way to you<%= " (or ready for pickup)" unless @order.address_line.present? %>. We hope you enjoy your pieces!
<% when "cancelled" %>
Your order <%= @order.number %> has been cancelled.<%= " Your payment will be refunded to your card." if @order.paid? %> If you have any questions, just reply to this email.
<% end %>

<%= render "summary", order: @order %>

— Preciso
